    LLM: 'If your hand lacks trumps or high-value doubles, drop out of the hand to avoid the Loo penalty.\n\nTaking the Miss is high-risk, high-reward. Use it if your current hand has only one low trump.\n\nDealer edge: Always use the swap to gain a trump unless your hand is already perfect (which is rare).',
